{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0064_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_07_title", "source_sha256": "353355b3e7e3f58ab014ddc36e9a80731cb63d3a662fbf0dece857a7b79ea12b", "ja": "タコパと雪合戦", "zh": "章鱼烧派对跟打雪仗", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0064_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_07_synopsis", "source_sha256": "e7bff2ff8f6139ba102c6a2a0c4ecf99c21107cbeec534254cfb3c66153cbc05", "ja": "ライブを成功させたメンバーの打ち上げは\nたこ焼きパーティー。そこに雪が降り始め、\nみんなは雪合戦をしようと外に出る。奈緒は\n響のおかげで成長できたと言い、2人は\nこれからも一緒に頑張ろう、と話す。", "zh": "演唱会圆满落幕后，\n众人举办章鱼烧派对当作庆功宴。\n此时下起雪来，大家到外头去打雪仗。\n奈绪表示自己有所成长都是多亏了响，\n两人约定好今后也要一起努力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0064_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_07_1000_p", "source_sha256": "b0c03490168aa1f878ab9c7b0cbe314fe0c48e55c35511c38caae55d342a8266", "ja": "（昨日の公演は無事、成功に終わった！\n打ち上げの準備は奈緒に任せることにしたのだが……）", "zh": "（昨天的公演圆满落幕了！\n我把准备庆功宴的事交给奈绪去办，不过……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0064_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_07_1001_p", "source_sha256": "3648fc242e4830da39840a7fdb65c8fcc5db3905d0b708681dc0ba0600fd0f4c", "ja": "なあ、奈緒。机の上に並べられている、\nこの大量の食材は、一体……？", "zh": "欸，奈绪。\n这些摆在桌上的大量食材究竟是……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0064_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_07_1002_037nao", "source_sha256": "a0a51245134df7c009b58d8d1a15b705b04b928d3c1d3d7d713c91bdf2e98d2f", "ja": "打ち上げ言うたら、\nトーゼン、たこ焼きパーティーやろ♪", "zh": "说到庆功宴，\n当然就要开章鱼烧派对吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0064_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_07_1003_037nao", "source_sha256": "d2468ba92d7753ea9f7c3e8c34ed1352888614a794340078eb87f44e681ec3f7", "ja": "家からたこ焼き器とか材料とかいろいろ\n持ってきたから、パーッと騒ぎましょー♪", "zh": "我从家里带了章鱼烧烤盘跟材料之类的，\n大家好好热闹一下嘿──♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0064_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_07_1004_024ann", "source_sha256": "19e269cbe48f8daa7a19d89a176e246a3f7b1b0924380ac0853a75fa5faedd40", "ja": "杏奈……たこ焼きパーティー……、\n初めて……。楽しそう……♪", "zh": "杏奈是……第一次……\n参加章鱼烧派对……感觉好有趣……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0064_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_07_1005_013hib", "source_sha256": "4aaa62bf0c89ba700ee738650f4e0d993b4820bdb0b562be44cf827c9ea6f800", "ja": "この前テレビで見たんだけど、大阪の人って、\nみんな家にたこ焼き器があるって、本当なの？", "zh": "本人之前看到电视上说，\n所有大阪人家里都有章鱼烧烤盘，这是真的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0064_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_07_1006_037nao", "source_sha256": "12da0599f42a1646ab651e4d09de17ea470625e3d31509bebcaf3abe24011d24", "ja": "ホンマかどうかはわからへんけど、\n私の周りの人はみんな持っとったな。", "zh": "我不知道是不是真的啦，\n不过我身边的人全部都有喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0064_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_07_1007_037nao", "source_sha256": "0419866a84ce9b67d0fe66b56e30ffad5ce1eb8e0f928a5ee9b930e6e1ad5c9a", "ja": "ちなみに、私の家には5台くらい\nたこ焼き器あんねん。欲しいなら1台ゆずろうか？", "zh": "顺带一提，我家里大概有五台章鱼烧烤盘。\n喜欢的话要不要拿一台去？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0064_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_07_1010_013hib", "source_sha256": "a3c4e0b8fd728f4a8ca90b505f890d34e3e422107fd8528a6ac708d880df1cb5", "ja": "え、いいの！？　ありがと、奈緒！", "zh": "咦，可以吗！？谢谢你，奈绪！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0064_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_07_1008_p", "source_sha256": "875f17fcfde7247a5b7483252bfbb7ea540f5443f946234f312881bfd87d25c5", "ja": "5台？　どうしてまた、そんなに？", "zh": "五台？为什么有这么多？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0064_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_07_1009_037nao", "source_sha256": "ca2e89bd70ecf2e2a6f95aeea5d7f5e880aca4a793406617526ea0c0562e963d", "ja": "もちろん、究極のたこ焼き器を探してたんです！\n結局、よう使うんは1台ぐらいやけどな。", "zh": "当然是因为我们一直在寻找究极的章鱼烧烤盘咩！\n结果最后常用的也只有一台就是了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0064_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_07_1011_041fuk", "source_sha256": "a4eca4b24a21c22e7729bafb7a19ae08048fdbf8d042851a03eb864835283f13", "ja": "たこ焼き、熱々だから、\n口の中をやけどしないように気をつけてね？", "zh": "章鱼烧很烫，\n吃的时候要注意别烫伤了喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0064_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_07_1012_014mir", "source_sha256": "8e3fb24cf04c63a60d50f2fee08a857d4d1383e4fbb5a2e8cad0df233352dc3c", "ja": "はーい♪　はふはふ……。……あちち！", "zh": "好──♪呼呼…………好烫！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0064_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_07_1013_041fuk", "source_sha256": "5138c8f0c7045fb4848443a55d5f3d15c0c27505af88819d1803ffebb09517a0", "ja": "ああっ！？　大丈夫、未来ちゃん！？", "zh": "啊啊！？未来你没事吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0064_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_07_1014_014mir", "source_sha256": "3f4ed5f4b2f438c7e4451268d5246672609d13cc93bbdffbfb141faa205ecbed", "ja": "全然平気ですっ♪　もう一個食べよっと！\nはふはふ……。あちち！", "zh": "完全不要紧♪再吃一个吧！\n呼呼……好烫！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0064_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_07_1015_p", "source_sha256": "e495a0f4825705c652e72623f429deebc8b2b7f375607faf8af90a2bdfc3d924", "ja": "（こうして、楽しい時間は、\nあっという間に過ぎて行く……）", "zh": "（开心的时光就这样转瞬即逝……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0064_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_07_1016_041fuk", "source_sha256": "f0641ef7778575471caff97dda7b42221e4abaad6a1ff006bed0393c110238ed", "ja": "ふぅ、ごちそうさまでした……お腹いっぱい♪\nとってもおいしかったわ！", "zh": "呼，谢谢招待……我吃得好饱♪\n真的很好吃呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0064_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_07_1018_037nao", "source_sha256": "e664d7defe1f18a22536467c8473f79b9764c365fa6990ddcd48a0cf5156b08b", "ja": "やっぱタコパは最高やな♪　また、みんなでやろな！\n……って、響、どうしたん？　窓の外じーっと見て。", "zh": "果然还是章鱼烧派对最棒了♪下次大家再一起办嘿！\n……咦，响你怎么了？一直盯着窗外看。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0064_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_07_1019_013hib", "source_sha256": "baa8ca4a9eb88992c5f36ae772c02aa31826744c9b81cc6818e27b33c31fa9c4", "ja": "みんな、雪が降ってるぞ！", "zh": "各位，外面下雪了喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0064_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_07_1020_014mir", "source_sha256": "bbecc49b749608186888ccd3d6f52523ccfcf424a3ede8e5de16e36bab4b9461", "ja": "えっ、雪！？\n見に行こう、みんな♪", "zh": "咦，下雪！？\n大家一起出去看吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0064_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_07_1021_024ann", "source_sha256": "89f34baaeafa9c1d75824f63e0c3d2961c05d14c0953113400d5c3fd10875bde", "ja": "うん……♪", "zh": "嗯……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0064_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_07_1022_013hib", "source_sha256": "0dc484a5c30f4f03429368935b1ad9b47986ee888cacd71c1039aafcb220f2d3", "ja": "うう、外、寒い……。\nでも雪、すっごくキレイだね！", "zh": "呜呜，外面好冷……\n不过雪真的很漂亮呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0064_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_07_1023_037nao", "source_sha256": "56aade6637ca2bb6af7d2c9c562b61b49a57f2ddc1a056457262b376a99bfa13", "ja": "響はやっぱ、雪、珍しいん？", "zh": "对响来说，下雪还是很稀奇吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0064_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_07_1024_013hib", "source_sha256": "aad4b913e1320d3d5e9e3a1884f3c118e9ab97f29b04cea1a5d1788c4ac14f53", "ja": "こっちに来てからは、結構見慣れたけど……。\nでも何回見ても、雪ってテンション上がるぞっ！", "zh": "本人到这里来以后，已经挺习惯下雪了……\n不过无论看几次，还是很令人兴奋！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0064_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_07_1025_024ann", "source_sha256": "2a424395c71c3b2c38daf5fb985999a338d2e1287500ea90283709a1c44b6f11", "ja": "杏奈もテンション上がってきたー！\n雪が積もったら、皆でビビッと雪合戦しようよ☆", "zh": "杏奈也觉得兴奋起来了──！\n等雪积起来以后，大家来打一场活力满满的雪仗吧☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0064_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_07_1026_014mir", "source_sha256": "d5b1dcdfbe648a336d78c95bd3dbe64757a97754dc0df0c0675b80cc3bd91f21", "ja": "いいね、やろやろ、ビビッと雪合戦♪", "zh": "不错耶，来玩吧，活力满满地打雪仗♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0064_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_07_1027_041fuk", "source_sha256": "840c1207ab31872226c23c2a49f3d1a157d1786e0ae639b306118b96d1106cbd", "ja": "ふふっ。カゼひかないように、\nあったかくしてから雪合戦しようね。", "zh": "呵呵，不过为了避免感冒，\n先让身体暖起来再打雪仗吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0064_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_07_1028_037nao", "source_sha256": "63b1f567ffbb46eee213dce76276bea35ff1dfcbf3b01100bfaaa22e1632c9bb", "ja": "えっと、響。", "zh": "那个，响。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0064_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_07_1029_013hib", "source_sha256": "51cd54af98a797be281c7a0651baf3335f719a0341798dbd62070225497b0301", "ja": "なに？　奈緒。", "zh": "什么事，奈绪？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0064_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_07_1030_037nao", "source_sha256": "fc37c43ba88fda35ad99e4e53fb2cba9c6d4e8b282accb7d1d51f21763be50e8", "ja": "こんな時に言うのもなんやけど、その……\nホンマに、ありがとうな。", "zh": "虽然现在说可能有点不适合……\n真的很谢谢你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0064_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_07_1031_013hib", "source_sha256": "4d6a9ded56c67d4eebb16942f58a083b11215ae80f6eccef13cc5c8ad387021b", "ja": "え？　……急にどうしたんだ、奈緒？", "zh": "咦……你怎么突然说这个？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0064_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_07_1032_037nao", "source_sha256": "5a423d1875c7fb787ce100bb03931e15f00f75792151327a2d3619e4205888d3", "ja": "いや……そういえば、お礼言うてなかったなって。\n響のおかげで、私、ちょっと成長できた気するわ。", "zh": "没什么……我只是突然想起还没向你道谢啦。\n这次多亏有响，我觉得自己稍微成长了一些。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0064_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_07_1033_013hib", "source_sha256": "c8bc4de9876a87c6a6b08f42b0ebab56f9e01f28b9c011d1e179b22a12ee20cc", "ja": "奈緒……。", "zh": "奈绪……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0064_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_07_1034_037nao", "source_sha256": "942476392839e651972810e9b900b89064aa6d6c27d7d0017de34512e1af8434", "ja": "私、みんなと一緒にライブやれて……一緒に\n『PRETTY DREAMER』歌えて良かったわ。", "zh": "我能跟大家一起举行演唱会……\n一起演唱『PRETTY DREAMER』，真的是太好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0064_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_07_1035_037nao", "source_sha256": "a19d694ca855b56b5bf96ae9f99f6f2f6eb8bd9fb266f6d908ce0ae6f90b2132", "ja": "だってこんなに気が合うことなんて、\nそうそうないやろ？", "zh": "毕竟像我们这么合拍的伙伴，\n很难碰到对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0064_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_07_1036_037nao", "source_sha256": "f51bb3b302de39f2313c0b1ce5e7f219a58393dc826b7e52cc060484b250945b", "ja": "あっ、これは別に歌詞に引っ掛けたんちゃうくてな？\nホンマに、ホンマにそう思ってるで！", "zh": "啊，我可不是因为想起歌词才这么说的嘿！\n我是真的、真的这么觉得！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0064_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_07_1037_013hib", "source_sha256": "9b97f0c758eb7f660141df63068b58a4d05e0727a1a9ec5aaa72ba183c230c25", "ja": "わかってるってば。……うん、そうだね！\nこれからも、自分たち一緒にがんばろう！", "zh": "本人知道啦……嗯，你说的对！\n今后我们也一起加油吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0064_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_07_1038_037nao", "source_sha256": "45689ddd1db270b27ecee737532471010d6f1c7801eec1fb21347e15f5102a4d", "ja": "せやな！　……けど、それと目の前の勝負とは別や。\n雪合戦は絶対に負けんから、覚悟しときやー！", "zh": "对啊！不过这跟现在的比赛可不能混为一谈。\n打雪仗我一定不会输的，做好心理准备吧──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0064_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_07_1039_013hib", "source_sha256": "b52bac63c3559da989787962c8f21ada3d5e4fb1021fb05bf54052b9e8149228", "ja": "それはこっちの台詞だぞっ！\n奈緒に、「参った」って言わせてやるさーっ！", "zh": "这是本人的台词才对喔！\n本人一定会让奈绪说出「甘拜下风」啦──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0064_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_07_1040_p", "source_sha256": "13a238f5e36e4aa4692dbf6f4e0da602fa431e087edccc0748d5a4e9ad46210e", "ja": "（その後、奈緒、杏奈、風花チームと\n響、未来、俺のチームに分かれ、雪合戦をした）", "zh": "（在这之后，大家分成两队，奈绪、杏奈、风花一队，\n响、未来跟我一队，一起打了雪仗。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0064_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_07_1041_p", "source_sha256": "cef71c1204bde6f5d14e7ab1eef43f9923ec419ea173e7d3ddcca725173a51bc", "ja": "（響は寒さのせいで全く動けず、俺達は\nボロ負けしたが……これも、楽しい思い出だな！）", "zh": "（天气太冷让响完全失去行动力，我们输得一败涂地……\n不过这也是快乐的回忆！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
